47
00:28:17.000 --> 00:28:48.000
with no aversive outcome being delivered, this would effectively, the idea was historically that this would effectively sort of remove that association or rub it out. But we know that's not the case now. And this is something that is well established within the empirical literature. We know that extinction is not an erasure of that association. It's not the removal of that association. And we know that thanks to a few different types of studies that have been conducted
且没有产生任何厌恶的结果，这实际上——历史上的观点是——将有效地消除这种联结或将其抹去。但我们现在知道事实并非如此。这是实证文献中已经充分确立的一点。我们知道消退并不是对这种联结的擦除。它不是这种联结的移除。多亏了所进行的几种不同类型的研究，我们才得以了解这一点。

