00:28:48.000 --> 00:29:40.000
and a few different types of phenomena that's been reported. One of those is simply referred to a spontaneous recovery. So another technical term, but it's a very simple process. And what that simply means is if you condition someone through extinction learning to expect that now when they're presented with the thing that they feared the rat, that no negative outcome will appear, you can see effective extinction. So the organism may start to be very calm and they may not to show that fear. However, you may try and test that again in hours, days, weeks, months later and suddenly that fear response reemergence. And that's a particular concern for us because we want people to not relapse. We want people to not fall back into these patterns and to learn to show these associations that they've previously.
以及已经报道过的一些不同类型的现象。其中之一简称为自发恢复。所以这也是一个专业术语，但过程非常简单。它的意思很简单，如果你通过消退学习对某人进行条件反射，让他们预期现在当他们面对他们害怕的东西——那只老鼠时，不会出现任何负面结果，你就能看到有效的消退。因此，有机体可能会开始变得非常平静，并且可能不会表现出那种恐惧。然而，你可能会在几小时、几天、几周、几个月后再次尝试测试，突然间那种恐惧反应又重新出现了。这让我们特别担忧，因为我们希望人们不要复发。我们希望人们不要落入这些模式中，并且学会表现出他们之前没有的那些联系。

